# Help: Rust DRM abstractions
#
# The kernel crate builds its drm module only under DRM=y (rust/kernel/
# lib.rs gates it on CONFIG_DRM = "y"), so DRM is built in here, not =m.
# Its GEM shmem and GPUVM parts build only for a driver that selects
# them, Tyr, which is Arm-only short of COMPILE_TEST.
# Self-contained: inlines rust.config's RUST and the RANDSTRUCT_NONE it
# requires.
# See: rust/kernel/drm/
CONFIG_RANDSTRUCT_NONE=y
CONFIG_RUST=y
CONFIG_DRM=y
